<title>USA: Bankers Trust to redeem all Series I pfd shrs.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust to redeem all Series I pfd shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust New York Corp said Wednesday it is exercising its option to redeem all of its 8.55 percent Series I cumulative preferred stock at $100 per share.</p>
<p>The redemption date is March 1. The price is equivalent to $25 per depository share. The bank said dividends will cease to accrue as of the redemption date.</p>
</text>
